{%- comment -%}
  Shared `<img>` renderer for every snippets/5dla_product-card-*.liquid's
  main product image - the eager-vs-deferred lazyload decision
  (sections/5dla_collection-product-grid.liquid's "Start Image Lazyload
  At" setting) lives here once instead of being duplicated per card.

  - A `<span class="c5dla-media-wrap c5dla-skeleton">` wraps the `<img>`.
    `c5dla-skeleton` is a generic, reusable skeleton/shimmer class (client/
    ver_2_0/scss/collection/_product-grid.scss) - NOT a base+modifier pair
    (no separate "is-loaded" class) - client/ver_2_0/js/modules/
    lazyload.js just REMOVES it outright once the image's own `load`/
    `error` event fires, which both stops the shimmer AND reveals the
    `<img>` (hidden - `display: none` - for as long as its wrapper still
    carries `c5dla-skeleton`). The wrapper (not the `<img>`) is what's
    sized to match the eventual image - a `<img>` with no `src` at all
    (the deferred case below) isn't reliably sized by width/height
    percentages in every browser, so the skeleton has to live on
    something whose size doesn't depend on the `<img>`'s own state at
    all; `c5dla-media-wrap` just fills its (already aspect-ratio'd, see
    each card's own `.product-image`/`.model-image-box`/etc.) parent at
    100%/100%, same as the `<img>` itself always has.
  - `index` (1-based, from the caller's own `forloop.index`) <=
    `section.settings.start_image_lazyload_at` renders a real `src` +
    `loading="eager"` - this product is usually already visible on page
    load, so there's nothing to gain by deferring it. Everything else
    renders `data-src` instead (no `src` at all) - lazyload.js promotes
    it to a real `src` once it scrolls near the viewport, loading it
    exactly once. Missing/blank `index` defaults to eager (fails safe -
    a caller that forgets to pass it gets today's "always load" behavior,
    not a silently broken image).

  Expects: media, alt, width (int - also the `image_url`/`width`
  attribute size), index, section
  Optional:
  - extra_attrs - a raw, PRE-BUILT HTML attribute string (e.g.
    `dynamic="product-image"`, snippets/5dla_product-card-3.liquid's
    variant-switch hook) - output unescaped; caller-controlled only, never
    raw user input.
  - extra_class - an additional class (e.g. card 2's `model-image`), on
    the `<img>` itself (not the wrapper).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign lazyload_threshold = section.settings.start_image_lazyload_at | default: 4
  assign is_eager_image = true
  if index != blank and index > lazyload_threshold
    assign is_eager_image = false
  endif

  assign media_src = media | image_url: width: width
-%}
<span class="c5dla-media-wrap c5dla-skeleton">
  <img
    class="{{ extra_class }}"
    {{ extra_attrs }}
    {% if is_eager_image %}
      src="{{ media_src }}"
      loading="eager"
    {% else %}
      data-src="{{ media_src }}"
    {% endif %}
    alt="{{ alt | default: '' | escape }}"
    width="{{ width }}"
    height="{{ width | divided_by: media.aspect_ratio }}"
  >
</span>
